WEBVTT

00:00.148 --> 00:05.353
Yume toki ashita no koto wa

00:05.353 --> 00:10.950
Dareni mo mienu deshou

00:12.861 --> 00:18.265
Me o tojite kimi o omou

00:19.367 --> 00:24.828
Itsuka de au

00:25.440 --> 00:31.470
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:31.713 --> 00:38.353
Watashi no kono me ni haru o misete

00:38.353 --> 00:44.724
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:45.026 --> 00:51.199
Sayonara fuyu no machi

00:51.199 --> 00:58.206
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:58.206 --> 01:04.479
Watashi no kokoro ni haru o yonde

01:04.479 --> 01:10.986
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

01:10.986 --> 01:18.358
Sayonara yukitachi yo

01:30.505 --> 01:36.077
Fujita-sama from Corporate Accounts,
please come to the Mage Action Division...

01:36.077 --> 01:38.747
The Training Division is in...

01:38.747 --> 01:41.773
the Department of General
Affairs and Human Resources...

01:42.784 --> 01:45.617
Inoue-san!
Good morning!

01:46.254 --> 01:48.449
Ah, good morning!

01:48.957 --> 01:53.451
While writing the report, I was able
to really organize my thoughts.

01:54.162 --> 01:56.464
I was able to let go of
my doubts and worries.

01:56.464 --> 01:58.166
Yes. It also gave me the incentive
to do my best through the end of training.

01:58.166 --> 02:01.870
Human Resources
Yes. It also gave me the incentive
to do my best through the end of training.

02:01.870 --> 02:05.362
Mage Trainees:
Submit mid-term reports here.
I'm glad to hear that.
Let's become certified mages together!

02:06.208 --> 02:08.476
Yume, you sure are sharp!

02:08.476 --> 02:11.012
Oh! Not necessarily!

02:11.012 --> 02:14.349
Ah! Angela, good morning!

02:14.349 --> 02:15.475
Good morning.

02:15.584 --> 02:16.885
Good morning.

02:16.885 --> 02:20.343
I ran into Inoue-san back by the elevators.

02:20.388 --> 02:21.753
Right!

02:25.060 --> 02:29.895
"Enormous Power in the Name of Love"

02:32.000 --> 02:34.502
Ah! What a relief to be done
with that report.

02:34.502 --> 02:37.005
Now we'll have
some peace of mind.

02:37.005 --> 02:38.940
Absolutely.
Don't you think so, Angela?

02:38.940 --> 02:39.838
Not really.

02:40.175 --> 02:42.837
Whoa, Angela.
You're always so calm.

02:42.911 --> 02:44.378
That's because Angela's so smart.

02:44.846 --> 02:47.508
That's not it!

02:48.350 --> 02:50.518
You've got a point there!

02:50.518 --> 02:53.688
All of us are different in our own way.
So, just do your best.

02:53.688 --> 02:54.484
That's right.

02:59.027 --> 03:00.289
Goodness...

03:03.698 --> 03:04.528
Yume-san?

03:05.133 --> 03:05.895
Yume!

03:05.934 --> 03:08.528
Are you all right?
Yume-san!

03:09.471 --> 03:11.268
Yume-san!

03:35.730 --> 03:37.899
Why?

03:37.899 --> 03:38.991
Tears...

03:51.613 --> 03:54.082
Ah! Thank you
for bringing my bag.

03:54.082 --> 03:56.209
They say that Yume had
a mild attack of anemia.

03:57.085 --> 03:59.554
She didn't eat breakfast,

03:59.554 --> 04:01.886
so she should be fine
after she eats something.

04:02.257 --> 04:05.393
Oh, my! Angela,
you look awfully pale, too.

04:05.393 --> 04:07.588
Maybe you've got a fever...

04:09.965 --> 04:13.128
Ugh! I'm sorry.
That was very rude of me...

04:22.277 --> 04:27.382
It looks like Angela
absolutely hates me...

04:27.382 --> 04:29.784
You shouldn't worry too much.

04:29.784 --> 04:32.120
Angela's just that kind of person.

04:32.120 --> 04:32.848
That kind of person?

04:33.421 --> 04:36.024
She's blunt,
and has her own pace.

04:36.024 --> 04:39.619
She has a strong sense of justice
and tends to be deeply moved.

04:40.462 --> 04:41.451
That's so cool.

04:41.930 --> 04:42.794
Huh?

04:57.712 --> 05:00.545
Hey! Have you heard
about that goofy trainee?

05:00.982 --> 05:04.352
Yeah! His name's Inoue or something.
He's older than us.

05:04.352 --> 05:09.346
And when he does a mage action, wow!
He's so slow and so weak!

05:10.058 --> 05:12.861
Well, isn't the guy
just an ordinary human?

05:12.861 --> 05:14.658
Oh, come on!
No way!

05:15.163 --> 05:15.993
Huh?

05:16.164 --> 05:19.292
It's unforgivable to talk bad
about someone behind their back!

05:19.501 --> 05:21.336
Who the heck are you?

05:21.336 --> 05:24.828
Hey! She's Angela... from
Master Chief Ginpun's office!

05:32.514 --> 05:35.915
I... Why did I get so upset?

05:40.855 --> 05:42.345
Angela!

05:42.857 --> 05:45.693
Thank you for your help earlier.
I'm feeling fine now.

05:45.693 --> 05:47.028
Good. I'm glad.

05:47.028 --> 05:50.429
Ah! Wait a minute! Would you like
to go and see Tokyo Tower with us?

05:52.200 --> 05:53.792
Tokyo Tower?

05:54.235 --> 05:56.465
Look! We can see it from here.

05:57.172 --> 05:58.764
That's it.

06:03.344 --> 06:06.381
Inoue-san's training
won't start until this evening.

06:06.381 --> 06:08.383
We're supposed to study
on our own today.

06:08.383 --> 06:10.715
So, why don't the three of us
go there together?

06:11.486 --> 06:12.587
- I'm not going.

06:12.587 --> 06:13.383
- I'm not going.
- How come?

06:13.888 --> 06:15.719
Because I don't want to.

06:17.392 --> 06:19.724
Is it because he's coming?

06:21.229 --> 06:21.729
So you really dislike
Inoue-san that much?

06:21.729 --> 06:24.732
This announcement is for
the mages who are standing by.
So you really dislike
Inoue-san that much?

06:24.732 --> 06:26.568
Those of you who are supposed
to attend your monthly meeting,
Did something happen?

06:26.568 --> 06:27.702
Those of you who are supposed
to attend your monthly meeting,
Nothing.

06:27.702 --> 06:31.573
please come to
the lobby to check in.
If you're not going,
I'm not going, either.

06:31.573 --> 06:33.341
please come to
the lobby to check in.
Why don't YOU go?

06:33.341 --> 06:34.808
please come to the
lobby to check in.
Maybe some other time.

06:37.345 --> 06:39.714
Well! I should get going now.

06:39.714 --> 06:41.614
Good-bye!

06:48.723 --> 06:51.626
Angela... Angela?

06:51.626 --> 06:53.761
You're just not yourself today...

06:53.761 --> 06:55.763
Are you coming down
with something?

06:55.763 --> 06:59.334
You look sort of pale,
and your eyes are watery, too.

06:59.334 --> 07:00.494
I'm not sick.

07:01.102 --> 07:04.265
Are you stressed over something?
I'll be happy to listen.

07:04.772 --> 07:06.941
It's not that.

07:06.941 --> 07:08.272
It's nothing, really.

07:16.417 --> 07:17.941
Hey, move over. Move over!

07:18.786 --> 07:21.016
So, you're trying to keep me
from doing my homework?

07:21.623 --> 07:23.625
Well, you're supposed to do
your homework at home.

07:23.625 --> 07:26.661
I know. But I have trouble
doing what I know is right.

07:26.661 --> 07:28.959
It's called life...

07:30.265 --> 07:33.792
This isn't a bad person.
In fact, very kind and gentle...

07:34.702 --> 07:37.728
But Angela dislikes
this person so much.

07:39.040 --> 07:40.735
I just don't understand
why she does.

07:41.342 --> 07:45.246
Well, this person wouldn't
happen to be a guy, would it?

07:45.246 --> 07:47.749
Yes. He's in
the same training course...

07:47.749 --> 07:50.741
He's a nice man
named Inoue-san.

07:55.156 --> 07:59.024
So, why don't you tell Angela about
the nice Inoue-san that YOU know?

07:59.127 --> 08:00.828
What? But, uh...

08:00.828 --> 08:02.728
Trust me. Just give it a try.

08:02.931 --> 08:05.923
Oh! I see.
It's a kind of shock therapy?

08:07.035 --> 08:08.730
I guess you could say that...

08:13.274 --> 08:14.609
I'm hanging up.

08:14.609 --> 08:17.345
Wait, wait!
Please don't hang up.

08:17.345 --> 08:18.379
Let's see...

08:18.379 --> 08:22.283
Um, Inoue-san was saying
that he was a little shocked...

08:22.283 --> 08:23.045
About what?

08:23.718 --> 08:25.887
About how you
keep avoiding him...

08:25.887 --> 08:28.590
He can't figure out what
he did to make you dislike him.

08:28.590 --> 08:32.627
Inoue-san was getting
discouraged all over again...

08:32.627 --> 08:35.460
He was just starting to get
re-motivated to continue his training.

08:36.965 --> 08:39.968
He's a nice person.
Why don't you be friendly to him?

08:39.968 --> 08:42.266
Well, if he's so nice,
then you be friendly to him!

08:42.804 --> 08:47.639
After all...
it's not my concern.

08:51.145 --> 08:51.804
Angela?

08:52.013 --> 08:54.538
Angela. What's wrong? Angela?

08:57.585 --> 09:00.349
Angela! Angela?

09:03.057 --> 09:04.490
Kera-san,
I'm using your bike!

09:05.560 --> 09:07.619
Oh! Hey!

09:38.092 --> 09:41.721
Running away...
Me?

09:45.833 --> 09:48.927
You're awake! I'm glad.

09:50.204 --> 09:51.671
Don't overdo it.

09:51.939 --> 09:53.600
I'm all right.

09:54.142 --> 09:58.613
You scared me... I mean, you fainted
in the middle of our phone conversation.

09:58.613 --> 10:02.550
I heard you hadn't eaten anything.
The housekeeper said so.

10:02.550 --> 10:04.609
It looks like you did what
I did this morning.

10:04.886 --> 10:07.388
I am eating...

10:07.388 --> 10:09.015
Sugako-san tends
to exaggerate.

10:09.223 --> 10:11.092
I bought you chicken hearts
and cheek meat...

10:11.092 --> 10:14.062
and some melon
and cream puffs!

10:14.062 --> 10:15.552
Later.

10:20.568 --> 10:22.737
Is there anything you want?

10:22.737 --> 10:23.771
No.

10:23.771 --> 10:26.641
Then... anything you want to do?

10:26.641 --> 10:27.909
I want to do?

10:27.909 --> 10:28.898
Tell me anything.

10:30.411 --> 10:33.414
There is something...
I want to do.

10:33.414 --> 10:35.316
What is it?

10:35.316 --> 10:36.943
I want to go to Tokyo Tower.

10:37.251 --> 10:40.243
What? Why?

10:40.922 --> 10:42.913
There's something
I want to clarify.

10:43.324 --> 10:45.258
Um... What is it?

10:46.427 --> 10:48.759
It's myself.

10:58.406 --> 11:00.441
It's so beautiful...

11:00.441 --> 11:06.004
Tokyo's such a wonderful, lucky place
to have such an awesome building.

11:06.280 --> 11:11.684
Too bad they close at ten,
or we could go up there.

11:12.687 --> 11:14.712
Hi, there! Sorry I'm late.

11:15.323 --> 11:18.793
Inoue-san, I'm sorry about
our unreasonable request.

11:18.793 --> 11:21.129
No problem. Whoa.

11:21.129 --> 11:23.996
It sure is magnificent when
you see the tower this close up.

11:24.132 --> 11:25.967
Oh, I get it!

11:25.967 --> 11:29.237
Angela-san, you wanted to see
Tokyo Tower at night, didn't you?

11:29.237 --> 11:33.298
It certainly is much more
beautiful at night, isn't it?

11:35.977 --> 11:38.479
Tell me what in the world
did you do?

11:38.479 --> 11:39.468
What?

11:39.947 --> 11:42.313
You did something to me,
didn't you?

11:43.151 --> 11:44.982
Angela, what are you talking about?

11:45.319 --> 11:47.922
Inoue-san used
his Special Power on me.

11:47.922 --> 11:48.616
Huh?

11:49.157 --> 11:52.320
No, I did not!
Why would I do a thing like that?

11:52.660 --> 11:59.400
I've never... not ever...
run away from... anything or anyone!

11:59.400 --> 12:01.834
This has never
happened to me before.

12:02.003 --> 12:04.439
I'm crying, getting upset, fainting...

12:04.439 --> 12:07.704
So, I thought
I should face it head on.

12:08.609 --> 12:10.702
If I don't do something
about it, I'll fall apart!

12:10.845 --> 12:14.679
But l... really didn't do anything...

12:15.516 --> 12:17.718
I have such weak power...

12:17.718 --> 12:21.154
There's no way, Angela-san,
that it would work on you.

12:30.731 --> 12:31.699
Do you know
where Yume-chan went?

12:31.699 --> 12:35.726
Yeah. After dinner she ran out
in a hurry to go somewhere.

12:36.204 --> 12:38.035
Hmm...

12:47.548 --> 12:48.708
It's time to go home.

12:48.816 --> 12:53.048
Let's go. It's getting late.
I'll take both of you home.

12:53.988 --> 12:57.048
Don't bother.
I can protect myself.

12:57.358 --> 12:58.347
Of course...

12:58.392 --> 13:02.230
Yes, that's right. You're more
self-reliant than I am...

13:02.230 --> 13:05.256
And certainly better
at using Special Power.

13:05.633 --> 13:08.236
Don't compare yourself
to other people!

13:08.236 --> 13:10.227
You're right.

13:12.073 --> 13:15.634
My poor Special Power
is my own problem.

13:15.676 --> 13:18.076
But you have
your good points.

13:19.747 --> 13:21.237
There's actually something
good about me?

13:21.415 --> 13:23.417
You're kind-hearted.

13:23.417 --> 13:25.486
I'm just timid.

13:25.486 --> 13:27.755
You're sensitive, aren't you?

13:27.755 --> 13:29.991
I just meddle into
other people's affairs.

13:29.991 --> 13:31.891
It means you're kind to everyone.

13:32.026 --> 13:34.262
But I run away from problems.

13:34.262 --> 13:36.093
Yes, but someday you'll stop.

13:37.598 --> 13:39.896
I'm not the type of guy
to say "follow me."

13:39.934 --> 13:42.603
Then you can follow someone.

13:42.603 --> 13:46.835
Yes. If there were only someone confident,
with a great gift for Special Power...

13:46.974 --> 13:50.102
Well, that person is RIGHT HERE!

13:52.880 --> 13:55.116
I'm confident and good with Special Power.

13:55.116 --> 13:57.318
I can say, "Follow me."

13:57.318 --> 13:59.878
What are you saying,
Angela-san?

14:00.187 --> 14:02.212
I care about you, Inoue-san.

14:05.293 --> 14:08.956
I just realized it.
I care so much.

14:09.230 --> 14:11.130
Now it makes sense...

14:12.300 --> 14:13.801
Wait a minute!

14:13.801 --> 14:16.571
Please don't tease me,
Angela-san.

14:16.571 --> 14:19.131
Are you going to
run away from me?

14:19.974 --> 14:21.066
But...

14:21.976 --> 14:23.739
You won't even stand
face-to-face with me?

14:23.778 --> 14:25.769
You won't even
look me in the eye!

14:29.483 --> 14:32.153
You actually just pity me,
don't you?

14:32.153 --> 14:35.384
There's no reason for you
to fall in love with me.

14:39.226 --> 14:41.160
Then you just watch me!

14:42.663 --> 14:44.324
Angela!

15:35.983 --> 15:37.245
Stop it, Angela!

15:37.585 --> 15:38.953
Don't interrupt me.

15:38.953 --> 15:40.215
But this is absolutely...

15:41.222 --> 15:44.214
Yume! I am dead serious!

15:45.626 --> 15:46.183
Angela...

15:46.394 --> 15:47.383
Angela-san!

15:47.662 --> 15:49.230
You've got to stop it.

15:49.230 --> 15:51.732
Don't you realize this
could ruin your training?

15:51.732 --> 15:54.168
You won't be able
to become a mage!

15:54.168 --> 15:56.737
Then give me your answer
to what I just told you!

15:56.737 --> 15:57.795
Look, that's a separate issue!

15:57.838 --> 15:59.328
No, it's not!

16:02.677 --> 16:06.080
Section A, Area 23.
A Level 7 mage action is taking place!

16:06.080 --> 16:12.178
Space curvature ratio: 50%.
Volume of mass involved: 4,000 tons.

16:39.447 --> 16:41.438
Once again,
it's Angela Brooks!

16:46.287 --> 16:48.289
That's it.
I've had enough of her!

16:48.289 --> 16:49.290
- I'll go.

16:49.290 --> 16:51.281
- I'll go.
- Huh?

16:51.659 --> 16:55.254
Chief! I thought you were returning
from Hong Kong tomorrow.

16:55.463 --> 17:00.901
Right now there is an enormous energy
brewing deep in Angela's heart,

17:00.901 --> 17:03.768
and she's not capable
of controlling it.

17:03.804 --> 17:07.508
No one else can calm
this particular kind of energy

17:07.508 --> 17:12.343
until Angela's able to confront herself,
and overcome this on her own.

17:12.713 --> 17:15.978
Until you receive my instructions,
do not make a move.

17:16.817 --> 17:19.479
But Chief Ginpun!
Angela Brooks is...

17:37.071 --> 17:38.333
Angela...

17:39.340 --> 17:40.329
Inoue-san!

17:41.942 --> 17:43.341
Angela's calling you.

17:44.678 --> 17:48.682
Inoue-san, don't run away.
Face her fair and square.

17:48.682 --> 17:52.019
That's easy for you to say,
but I have no idea what to do!

17:52.019 --> 17:54.188
Then, just say so!

17:54.188 --> 17:57.157
Inoue-san, I love you!

17:57.691 --> 18:00.558
I don't care if you're not good
with Special Power!

18:00.594 --> 18:04.360
Because, as a person,
you possess far better qualities.

18:05.299 --> 18:07.699
Your kind heart
and your gentleness...

18:08.869 --> 18:11.360
You made me aware
of those qualities.

18:12.006 --> 18:13.769
And so that's why
I LOVE YOU!

18:23.818 --> 18:24.978
Inoue-san...

18:33.394 --> 18:34.156
Angela-san...

18:34.562 --> 18:38.054
Finally... you're
looking me in the eye.

18:38.232 --> 18:40.962
You did this for me?

18:43.237 --> 18:47.401
For you, I did something
only I could do.

18:50.711 --> 18:54.272
It's so out of the blue
and I have no idea what to do...

18:54.915 --> 18:57.713
But I really appreciate
your feelings for me.

18:58.285 --> 19:05.521
So... we should talk more...
walk together... laugh, fight and...

19:06.227 --> 19:09.162
I want to know...
more about you.

19:47.701 --> 19:49.532
Inoue-san.

19:50.537 --> 19:53.335
I'll be fine. I'll explain
everything to them.

19:57.611 --> 19:59.203
You can't reverse it?

20:00.414 --> 20:01.615
Correct.

20:01.615 --> 20:04.482
I apologize, Master.

20:47.127 --> 20:52.866
Well, now. Angela said you had
nothing to do with all of this.

20:52.866 --> 20:55.096
But, if so, I wonder
why you're here.

20:55.202 --> 20:58.194
Well, uh... it's...

20:59.440 --> 21:00.607
Love?

21:00.607 --> 21:01.938
Yes, Master.

21:02.042 --> 21:05.713
But, if I try to explain,
it'll take until tomorrow morning.

21:05.713 --> 21:08.045
Even if it takes a week,
it's all right with me.

21:08.482 --> 21:10.177
Tell me everything.

21:10.250 --> 21:12.013
Yes, sir.

21:19.927 --> 21:26.560
Furikaereba ima demo soko ni

21:29.603 --> 21:35.940
Oikaketeta mirai ga atta

21:37.811 --> 21:46.820
Boku no kokoro ni aru taisetsu na mono

21:46.820 --> 21:51.689
Mada mienai ao to

21:52.926 --> 21:59.593
Nagareru kumo ni negatta

22:02.369 --> 22:04.200
Under the Blue Sky

22:04.605 --> 22:11.704
Ano hi bokura ga egaita yume kara

22:11.979 --> 22:18.384
Samenai you ni tomaranai you ni

22:21.355 --> 22:23.390
Under the Blue Sky

22:23.390 --> 22:30.228
Kagayaki nagara aruiteikou yo

22:30.631 --> 22:37.537
Owaranai tabi wa tsuzuku

22:49.550 --> 22:50.818
PREVIEW

22:50.818 --> 22:52.019
PREVIEW
You've got a tough road
ahead of you!

22:52.019 --> 22:52.986
You've got a tough road
ahead of you!

22:52.986 --> 22:54.388
What do you mean?

22:54.388 --> 22:57.091
Are you playing dumb or what?
Your boyfriend!

22:57.091 --> 22:59.093
- "Oh, my sweet darling!" Right?

22:59.093 --> 23:00.561
- "Oh, my sweet darling!" Right?
- Hmm.

23:00.561 --> 23:02.863
Is that all?
You're so "dispassionate"!

23:02.863 --> 23:04.194
Anything else you want to say?

23:04.264 --> 23:05.663
Uh, not exactly,
but you know what?

23:05.899 --> 23:07.067
Not really.

23:07.067 --> 23:08.869
For example, the flame of love,

23:08.869 --> 23:11.839
just like the one between
me and Masami-chan, may...

23:11.839 --> 23:14.675
"Yume and a Girl and a Summer Seed"
The next episode, Episode Nine, is
"Yume and a Girl and a Summer Seed"

23:14.675 --> 23:16.009
"Yume and a Girl and a Summer Seed"
I hope you look forward to it!

23:16.009 --> 23:19.467
"Yume and a Girl and a Summer Seed"
Hey! Hey! Why are you ignoring me!
